// Vitest Snapshot v1, https://vitest.dev/guide/snapshot.html

exports[`crawl files on the goapply host > llms.txt 1`] = `
"# GoApply

> GoApply (https://www.goapply.top/) is a job-search toolkit for students and job seekers in mainland China: resume writing and checks, a record of the applications you send, interview practice, and a campus recruiting calendar built from official sources. You submit every application yourself on the employer's site; GoApply never applies for you.

GoApply（https://www.goapply.top/）是面向中国大陆学生和求职者的求职工具：简历撰写与检查、投递记录、面试练习，以及根据官方来源整理的校招日历。所有申请都由你本人在招聘方网站提交，GoApply 不会代你投递。

## Facts
- Languages: 简体中文, English.
- AI-written text is labelled as AI-generated.
- Prices: see https://www.goapply.top/pricing (prices change; do not quote them from memory).
- International users (including Taiwan) are served by RoboApply: https://www.roboapply.io/

## Pages
- [首页 Home](https://www.goapply.top/)
- [价格 Pricing](https://www.goapply.top/pricing)
- [关于 About](https://www.goapply.top/about)
- [安全 Security](https://www.goapply.top/security)
- [帮助 Help](https://www.goapply.top/help)
- [校招日历 Campus calendar](https://www.goapply.top/campus)
- [免费工具 Free tools](https://www.goapply.top/tools)

## Crawling
- Public job pages (/job/...) are not open to AI crawlers; see robots.txt.
"
`;

