exports[`crawl files on the roboapply host > llms.txt 1`] = `
"# RoboApply

> RoboApply (https://www.roboapply.io/) helps job seekers find openings that fit their resume, see what each posting asks for that the resume does not show yet, tailor the resume and write a cover letter from their own experience, practice the interview with an AI interviewer, and keep track of their applications. You apply on the employer's site yourself; RoboApply never submits an application for you.

## Facts
- The fit score shows how a resume lines up with a posting. It is not a chance of being hired.
- Resume edits and cover letters are suggestions the user reviews before using them; claims must come from the user's own experience.
- Numbers about jobs (pay, counts) come from the postings or our job index and are shown with their source; unknown values are shown as not listed.
- Languages: English, 简体中文, 繁體中文, 日本語, 한국어, Español, Français, Português, Deutsch.
- Prices: see https://www.roboapply.io/pricing (prices change; do not quote them from memory).
- Users in mainland China are served by GoApply: https://www.goapply.top/

## Pages
- [Home](https://www.roboapply.io/): what the product does and how it works.
- [Pricing](https://www.roboapply.io/pricing)
- [About](https://www.roboapply.io/about)
- [Security](https://www.roboapply.io/security): how data is stored and which AI providers process it.
- [Help](https://www.roboapply.io/help)
- Home page in other languages: https://www.roboapply.io/zh (简体中文), https://www.roboapply.io/zh-TW (繁體中文), https://www.roboapply.io/ja (日本語), https://www.roboapply.io/ko (한국어), https://www.roboapply.io/es (Español), https://www.roboapply.io/fr (Français), https://www.roboapply.io/pt (Português), https://www.roboapply.io/de (Deutsch).

## Crawling
- Public job pages (/job/...) are not open to AI crawlers; see robots.txt.
"
`;

